Bella Napoli Pizza is a family-owned Italian-style pizzeria known for traditional pizzas, fresh ingredients,
and a relaxed atmosphere. The restaurant combines classic Neapolitan-inspired recipes with a few modern
creations .Bella Napoli Pizza is located at 24 Vitosha Boulevard, Sofia, Bulgaria, close to the city center.
The restaurant is situated in a lively area surrounded by shops, cafes, and other restaurants, making it a
convenient place for both locals and visitors.Bella Napoli Pizza was founded in 1998 by Marco Rossi, an
Italian chef who moved to Sofia after spending several years working in family restaurants in Naples.
His goal was to introduce authentic Italian pizza-making techniques while adapting the menu slightly
to local tastes.The restaurant focuses on simple ingredients and traditional preparation. Pizza dough
is prepared fresh every day and allowed to rest before baking. The kitchen uses tomato sauce, mozzarella,
vegetables, meats, and herbs selected for their flavor and quality.Bella Napoli Pizza has been serving
customers for more than 25 years. The restaurant's most popular pizza is the Pepperoni, while the Margherita
remains one of the most frequently ordered classic pizzas. The restaurant offers pizzas in both 30 cm and
40 cm sizesAmong the most popular menu items are Pepperoni, Margherita, Four Cheese, Prosciutto e Funghi,
and Diavola. Customers looking for vegetarian options can choose the Vegetarian pizza or the Margherita.
The restaurant has a casual and welcoming atmosphere. The interior combines traditional Italian decorations
with a modern dining area. It is suitable for casual lunches, dinners with friends, family meals, and 
small celebrations. Bella Napoli Pizza offers dine-in and takeaway service. The menu includes pizzas, 
appetizers, salads, desserts, and soft drinks. The restaurant does not claim that all dishes are suitable
for people with food allergies, so customers with allergies should ask staff about ingredients before ordering.
